.env.test.local
.env.production.local
# Tracked exceptions — these contain only PUBLIC build-time values
# (apex domain, API origin, Razorpay publishable key) that get baked
# into the client bundle anyway. Committing them removes the
# dependency on CI env-var-injection-into-build-shell, which is
# unreliable across hosts (history: Amplify; current: Cloudflare
# Pages via GitHub Actions).
!.env.development
!.env.production
!.env.testing

